  "title": "New Bags | Louis Vuitton Presents Spring-Summer 2027 Womenswear Collection: Ergonomics",
  "original_title": "新包 | Louis Vuitton 发布2027春夏女装系列：人体工学",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton’s Spring/Summer 2027 Paris show featured Nicolas Ghesquière’s “Ergonomie” theme, blending lightweight silks into fluid dresses and coats exploring body movement.",
