      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Louis Vuitton Spring/Summer 2027 womenswear show has just wrapped at the Louvre in Paris. This season's theme, \"Ergonomie,\" saw artistic director of womenswear Nicolas Ghesquière weave composite chiffon, silk scarves, and silk-cashmere scarf fabrics into dresses, coats, and knitwear. Lightweight materials and streamlined cuts highlight the beauty of the body in motion, exploring the intuitive relationship between clothing, the body, and movement.",
