    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Louvre's Cour Carrée was transformed into a surrealist futuristic city, with 34 concept cars adorned in cream and forest-green Damier checkerboard motifs suspended above the runway, creating a striking contrast with the Louvre's classical architecture. Models walked through this frozen tableau, evoking a intriguing sense of temporal and spatial displacement.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
