    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Monogram Flower ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new-season bags revolve around the brand's iconic Monogram Flower motif. The flap bag features a clean rectangular silhouette paired with a three-dimensional four-petal flower clasp that opens with a twist—a playful, ingenious detail. The bowling bag is accented with Monogram Flower decorations at the strap junctions, while its vintage zip-top shape exudes a preppy charm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
