    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This bag features a full-flap design, with its standout detail being an openwork Monogram Flower ring at the strap junction. The diamond-quilted pattern on the body is inspired by the interior of the classic hard trunks, or alternatively, the Damier checkerboard pattern is rendered through inlaid crocodile leather in contrasting colors—a fresh reinterpretation of the brand's archival symbols.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
