    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Hobo Bloom bag is crafted from materials such as Epi textured leather or Monogram canvas, shaping a fluid crescent silhouette. Its compact size conforms to the body's posture in motion, echoing this season's \"Ergonomie\" theme. The side seams are accented with Monogram four-leaf clover and three-dimensional stud decorations, ensuring that even when worn on the shoulder, the most exquisite details remain visible.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
