    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Cavale bag also incorporates the \"Ergonomie\" philosophy into its design. Crafted from a lightweight blend of canvas and leather, its fluid curved silhouette and wavy top-edge cut allow the bag to hug the body's lines when worn. The handwritten L.Vuitton leather logo contrasts sharply with the canvas background, boldly asserting the brand's identity.",
