      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new chain bag features a clean, streamlined envelope structure, with Epi textured leather shaping an architectural silhouette and a metal chain strap adding a lively, free-spirited touch. The same collection also introduces a slim pochette style, a three-in-one design combining Epi leather, crocodile leather, and patent leather that can be freely disassembled and combined, adding versatility and fun to styling.",
      "url": null,
