      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The classic Monogram canvas collection introduces a top-opening shoulder bag with a vintage, timeless appeal; the Multipass bag makes a comeback in milk-tea-colored waxed leather; the small hand-held hard trunk features a cream Epi leather elongated silhouette, its minimalist construction paying tribute to archival trunk-making craftsmanship; and the Alma shell bag pairs a structured form with black-and-white contrasting patent leather accents, reminiscent of racing livery, presenting a retro-futuristic style.",
